WEBVTT

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.920
Arusu came to the Magical Realm...

00:00:55.022 --> 00:00:57.821
...and went to the Warlock Realm
for the very first time.

00:00:57.925 --> 00:01:00.690
They also called it
Wizard Kingdom and...

00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:04.196
...they used science as a way
of life instead of using magic.

00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:08.431
Arusu and the others disguised
themselves, but their cover is blown.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:10.299
Eva was captured...

00:01:10.471 --> 00:01:13.497
...and Arusu was saved by wizards
who were trying to protect...

00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:15.234
...their tradition of magic.

00:01:15.342 --> 00:01:19.108
And Sheila found out about
their collapsing realm.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:50.702
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.242 --> 00:02:59.702
Backs Against the Wall

00:03:03.517 --> 00:03:06.452
There's only one way to save this realm.

00:03:06.987 --> 00:03:08.921
The forbidden dark magic.

00:03:09.156 --> 00:03:12.057
Wait. Is that why you're
trying to capture the fairies...

00:03:12.159 --> 00:03:14.253
...and the True Book of Spells?

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:16.989
Plus a witch who can use
the power of dark magic.

00:03:17.097 --> 00:03:18.587
You must be kidding!

00:03:18.699 --> 00:03:22.932
Dark magic is the magic of darkness.
It'll destroy everything!

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.605
Magic like that can't
possibly save the realm.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.405
What's so funny?

00:03:28.509 --> 00:03:30.910
You saw the port for the
Sanctuary, didn't you?

00:03:31.011 --> 00:03:34.709
And you call that a graveyard?
They're deceiving you.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:38.810
Come to the Warlock Realm as
a witch who can use dark magic.

00:03:38.919 --> 00:03:39.579
Me?

00:03:39.753 --> 00:03:43.815
This is no time to think about tradition
or doing what you want for yourself.

00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:47.056
We have to save this realm.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.629
Then we can talk about other things.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:50.991
But that's...

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.092
Got it?

00:03:58.105 --> 00:03:58.731
Yes.

00:04:07.581 --> 00:04:09.447
What's happening to me?

00:04:17.558 --> 00:04:18.616
There.

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.426
Attack!

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:28.360
Arusu. That's called time-space magic.

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:31.864
Not too bad for an old guy, right?

00:04:31.939 --> 00:04:34.636
| can only stop them for a little bit.

00:04:34.775 --> 00:04:36.903
Wil, everyone! What are you doing here?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.571
Magic creates miracles.
That's what you said, Arusu.

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:41.546
Yeah!

00:04:41.915 --> 00:04:43.383
Go help Arusu!

00:04:43.684 --> 00:04:45.461
Show them the power of the wizards!

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:46.611
Show them the power of the wizards!
But Wil...

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.516
I know.

00:04:47.621 --> 00:04:50.886
We don't want to hurt each other
by using our favorite magic either.

00:04:50.991 --> 00:04:54.052
Plus they're warlocks,
just like us. Forget about it.

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:57.896
Okay! Here I come, Eva!

00:05:01.702 --> 00:05:03.602
Grande. Please be careful.

00:05:03.704 --> 00:05:07.607
There's a witch in our headquarters.
Plus the wizards are here as well...

00:05:19.319 --> 00:05:21.014
Where's Eva?

00:05:21.221 --> 00:05:22.620
She's...

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:25.322
Hurry up and say it!

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:29.419
If you don't, then I'll make
that snake swallow you up!

00:05:34.968 --> 00:05:35.764
Haru...

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:37.767
Please come out.

00:05:38.372 --> 00:05:39.066
Haru!

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.042
Good! I'm free!

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:49.438
Sigma of the reconnoitering
party has returned.

00:05:50.217 --> 00:05:51.651
You may enter.

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:54.947
| brought an apprentice witch
who uses dark magic.

00:05:55.689 --> 00:05:56.554
Good job.

00:05:56.823 --> 00:05:59.087
She's completely under our control.

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:01.524
Where's the True Book of Spells?

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:04.220
Well, they don't seem to have it...

00:06:04.531 --> 00:06:10.231
The other two witches might know
where the True Book of Spells is.

00:06:10.337 --> 00:06:11.463
What did you say?

00:06:11.605 --> 00:06:14.233
Are you telling me that
the other two are...

00:06:14.341 --> 00:06:17.641
...the one who's currently fleeing
and the one we captured?

00:06:17.744 --> 00:06:20.076
Where is she right now?

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:24.172
If I can get close to her,
then I can make her confess.

00:06:24.284 --> 00:06:26.446
She's in the underground chapel.
Take her there.

00:06:26.553 --> 00:06:27.213
Yes...

00:06:32.192 --> 00:06:33.091
Sheila!

00:06:34.161 --> 00:06:37.324
You lied to me about the whereabouts
of the True Book of Spells.

00:06:37.431 --> 00:06:38.023
What?

00:06:38.699 --> 00:06:40.997
Hey! Make her confess at once...

00:06:41.935 --> 00:06:44.029
Who do you think
you're giving orders to?

00:06:44.171 --> 00:06:46.902
Why you... You deceived me!

00:06:47.007 --> 00:06:50.068
Let's go, Eva! We'll use him as
a hostage to get us out of here!

00:06:50.177 --> 00:06:50.769
Okay!

00:06:51.645 --> 00:06:52.874
| don't think so!

00:06:54.047 --> 00:06:56.812
Get out of the way! If you don't,
I'll take him and...

00:06:56.917 --> 00:06:57.645
Sigma.

00:06:57.851 --> 00:07:00.286
You asked for it.
Don't hold a grudge against us.

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:01.343
What!

00:07:02.589 --> 00:07:03.750
Capture them!

00:07:06.593 --> 00:07:08.357
I made it in time!

00:07:11.865 --> 00:07:13.060
Arusu!

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:17.262
Come on, Sheila. You should've told me
if you were going to rescue her.

00:07:17.404 --> 00:07:18.997
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:07:19.106 --> 00:07:20.039
All right!

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:21.399
Hey!

00:07:21.742 --> 00:07:23.767
You're a nuisance!

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:30.681
Wait a minute!

00:07:31.685 --> 00:07:32.379
What's wrong?

00:07:32.619 --> 00:07:34.747
We have to save the fairies too!

00:07:34.821 --> 00:07:36.332
What? You saw fairies?

00:07:36.356 --> 00:07:36.845
What? You saw fairies?
Yeah!

00:07:36.957 --> 00:07:38.601
No! Our first priority is to escape.

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:39.615
No! Our first priority is to escape.
Where are they?

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.394
I think it's this way!

00:07:42.395 --> 00:07:43.055
Hey!

00:07:44.164 --> 00:07:45.495
Protect Arusu!

00:07:45.599 --> 00:07:47.567
Don't let her get a scratch!

00:07:47.701 --> 00:07:48.600
Okay!

00:07:51.338 --> 00:07:52.567
Who are you?

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:56.131
A magical spirit summoned by Arusu.

00:07:58.111 --> 00:08:00.079
Oops-a-daisy. There.

00:08:09.656 --> 00:08:10.433
Go!

00:08:10.457 --> 00:08:11.185
But...

00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:13.622
| can't bring this down
if you stay there!

00:08:14.194 --> 00:08:14.820
Right!

00:08:27.407 --> 00:08:28.431
Wil...

00:08:28.608 --> 00:08:31.270
I'm counting on you...

00:08:32.045 --> 00:08:33.069
Sheila!

00:08:33.713 --> 00:08:34.578
Hurry!

00:08:41.755 --> 00:08:43.553
Leave the rest to me.

00:08:47.727 --> 00:08:48.990
Ah, the fairy!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.456
Arusu!

00:08:51.965 --> 00:08:52.898
Watch out!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.293
What are you doing?

00:08:58.839 --> 00:09:00.967
Don't worry about me! Just go!

00:09:01.208 --> 00:09:04.769
No! You have to come with us!
Nito is waiting for your return!

00:09:04.878 --> 00:09:06.107
Listen carefully, Arusu!

00:09:06.179 --> 00:09:07.390
We have to get out of here fast!

00:09:07.414 --> 00:09:09.075
We have to get out of here fast!
Just listen!

00:09:09.282 --> 00:09:12.775
It sounds strange to ask this
of a human like yourself...

00:09:12.886 --> 00:09:15.912
...but maybe I'm asking you
because you're human.

00:09:16.022 --> 00:09:19.481
No matter what happens,
don't let the power of magic die out!

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:22.524
The only magic capable of
destroying the dark magic...

00:09:22.662 --> 00:09:24.255
...is the light magic.

00:09:24.364 --> 00:09:26.731
For 200 years, we fought against...

00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:29.825
...Wizard Kingdom to
keep that magic alive!

00:09:29.936 --> 00:09:31.495
That is our only wish!

00:09:31.705 --> 00:09:33.002
Light magic?

00:09:33.206 --> 00:09:34.640
Hurry up and go!

00:09:34.841 --> 00:09:35.740
Wil...

00:09:35.876 --> 00:09:37.002
Farewell!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.436
Wil!

00:09:40.547 --> 00:09:43.744
Arusu, eh? That's a good name.

00:09:45.452 --> 00:09:46.749
Wil!

00:09:46.853 --> 00:09:47.649
Arusu!

00:09:49.356 --> 00:09:50.289
Wil...

00:09:58.398 --> 00:10:00.366
You'll be held responsible.

00:10:10.243 --> 00:10:12.041
Welcome back!

00:10:14.281 --> 00:10:16.215
Where's grandpa and the rest?

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:21.144
I'm sorry, Nito.

00:10:22.889 --> 00:10:23.788
I'm sorry.

00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:29.027
I'm going to protect the magic.

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:33.126
I'll definitely protect it for Wil...

00:10:33.934 --> 00:10:34.696
So...

00:10:44.277 --> 00:10:45.540
Promise?

00:10:46.646 --> 00:10:48.740
Yeah. I promise.

00:10:55.789 --> 00:10:59.748
If I were to die tomorrow,
I'll eat lots of chestnuts...

00:10:59.859 --> 00:11:04.228
...take care of Yoko
and sleep during class.

00:11:05.966 --> 00:11:10.199
Even if it's boring, I realized that
the boring things that I did every day...

00:11:10.303 --> 00:11:13.603
...were in fact the most
important things in my life.

00:11:15.141 --> 00:11:16.040
Arusu...

00:11:33.226 --> 00:11:36.218
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.767 --> 00:11:45.227
Magical Girl Squad

00:11:49.743 --> 00:11:50.369
Boo.

00:11:51.144 --> 00:11:52.077
Hey, Arusu.

00:11:52.145 --> 00:11:52.668
Boo?

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:54.403
Boo?

00:11:55.281 --> 00:11:57.045
No, it's nothing.

00:11:57.817 --> 00:11:59.362
Your meal is almost ready, Sheila.

00:11:59.386 --> 00:12:00.512
Your meal is almost ready, Sheila.
No thanks.

00:12:02.122 --> 00:12:03.851
Hey, Arusu.

00:12:03.957 --> 00:12:04.515
Boo?

00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:06.889
It's about Sheila.

00:12:07.027 --> 00:12:07.653
Boo.

00:12:07.961 --> 00:12:10.225
She's acting strange, don't you think?

00:12:10.997 --> 00:12:12.931
Ever since we got back here...

00:12:16.703 --> 00:12:19.138
Who is this witch you speak of?

00:12:21.074 --> 00:12:22.303
Grand Master.

00:12:22.776 --> 00:12:24.870
I thought I told you not to come in.

00:12:24.978 --> 00:12:26.241
I'm really sorry.

00:12:26.446 --> 00:12:29.882
But the apprentice witch
Sheila wants to see you.

00:12:31.584 --> 00:12:32.983
Let her in.

00:12:34.454 --> 00:12:36.513
| came back from the Sanctuary.

00:12:36.623 --> 00:12:38.113
The Sanctuary?

00:12:38.391 --> 00:12:40.621
You saw what was going on.

00:12:40.727 --> 00:12:42.491
So it's true?

00:12:43.696 --> 00:12:45.164
What is this about?

00:12:46.466 --> 00:12:51.404
I guess it's time to
tell you everything.

00:12:54.274 --> 00:12:55.366
No way...

00:12:56.276 --> 00:13:00.213
This is the truth that
you were telling me about?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:05.547
It can't be...

00:13:05.685 --> 00:13:10.919
I'm sure you understand this, but
you must never tell this to anyone.

00:13:11.424 --> 00:13:17.591
If you do, then it will cause unrest
and confusion among the people.

00:13:18.164 --> 00:13:19.097
Atelia.

00:13:20.433 --> 00:13:22.094
| understand.

00:13:22.702 --> 00:13:23.692
Excuse me.

00:13:24.104 --> 00:13:25.594
You have more to say?

00:13:25.705 --> 00:13:29.107
Can you send both Eva and Arusu
to the Human Realm?

00:13:29.242 --> 00:13:30.641
Human Realm?

00:13:30.844 --> 00:13:34.337
Are you telling us to send
them both to a graveyard?

00:13:34.948 --> 00:13:36.541
What graveyard?

00:13:38.418 --> 00:13:40.318
| saw the port!

00:13:41.788 --> 00:13:44.280
Everything you said
was a lie, wasn't it?

00:13:45.291 --> 00:13:46.781
Arusu may not be...

00:13:46.893 --> 00:13:50.329
...but Eva is just a child.
It's the same thing as killing her.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:53.400
That's what the grand master
wanted to say...

00:13:53.466 --> 00:13:55.457
That's why I came here to ask you!

00:13:55.768 --> 00:13:59.398
| want you to remove the
Curse of Eternal Youth from her!

00:14:00.206 --> 00:14:01.833
Now listen...

00:14:02.108 --> 00:14:03.439
Grand Master?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:04.871
I'm fine.

00:14:05.945 --> 00:14:09.210
If this gets out to the public,
then I'm sure every...

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:12.376
...civilian will be thinking
of the same thing.

00:14:12.485 --> 00:14:17.980
But it's just impossible to send
everyone to the Human Realm.

00:14:18.224 --> 00:14:21.660
As the head of this Witch Realm...

00:14:21.761 --> 00:14:26.255
.| can't provide special treatment
for just one person.

00:14:27.567 --> 00:14:30.161
With pride and tradition by our side...

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.534
...we just wait for our death.

00:14:32.639 --> 00:14:37.008
That is the destiny for us witches.

00:14:37.143 --> 00:14:38.406
It can't be...

00:14:39.179 --> 00:14:41.375
Please say something, Atelia!

00:14:42.148 --> 00:14:45.880
No matter what happens
I have to obey her wishes.

00:14:46.986 --> 00:14:49.318
If you want the curse to be removed...

00:14:49.422 --> 00:14:53.325
...then just keep on capturing the fairies
like before. That's the only way.

00:14:58.831 --> 00:15:00.492
Hey, look at this, Arusu.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.377
It sprouted!

00:15:01.401 --> 00:15:02.800
It sprouted!
You're right!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:07.433
Take a look at this, Sheila.
It's sprouting.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.507
Slimy!

00:15:08.641 --> 00:15:09.574
Having fun?

00:15:09.676 --> 00:15:11.906
We should have fun in life.

00:15:12.078 --> 00:15:12.772
Here.

00:15:13.947 --> 00:15:16.746
Hey, fairies! Let's try to
outstare each other again!

00:15:17.717 --> 00:15:19.628
I've decided, Sheila.

00:15:19.652 --> 00:15:20.346
I've decided, Sheila.
Huh?

00:15:20.486 --> 00:15:24.354
We can let the fairies roam around free,
protect the witches' tradition...

00:15:24.457 --> 00:15:26.391
...or become an adult.

00:15:26.526 --> 00:15:29.552
But first, we have to protect
the fairies from the warlocks.

00:15:29.829 --> 00:15:33.094
We will protect the magic from
the warlocks who are trying to get...

00:15:33.199 --> 00:15:36.396
...the fairies and the True Book
of Spells and destroy magic!

00:15:37.604 --> 00:15:41.131
Because we're the Magical
Girl Squad that loves magic!

00:15:41.274 --> 00:15:43.140
That's great, Arusu!

00:15:43.243 --> 00:15:45.575
Magical Girl Squad! That sounds so cool!

00:15:45.678 --> 00:15:48.773
Right? I didn't sleep last night
since I was coming up with that!

00:15:48.881 --> 00:15:50.576
Give me a break!

00:15:50.683 --> 00:15:52.151
Sheila?

00:15:52.318 --> 00:15:53.462
Go back to the Human Realm.

00:15:53.486 --> 00:15:54.180
What?

00:15:54.287 --> 00:15:58.349
But the Port of Departure
was just a graveyard...

00:15:58.491 --> 00:16:00.357
It wasn't like that at all.

00:16:00.927 --> 00:16:04.989
| saw it with my own eyes. The real
Port of Departure at the Sanctuary.

00:16:05.298 --> 00:16:07.062
If you stow away on that ship...

00:16:07.133 --> 00:16:09.932
...then you might be able to
go back to the Human Realm.

00:16:10.036 --> 00:16:12.368
| can go back to the Human Realm?

00:16:12.505 --> 00:16:13.370
What?

00:16:15.375 --> 00:16:17.002
We have trouble, Sheila!

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.369
The grand master has collapsed!

00:16:22.782 --> 00:16:24.011
How is she?

00:16:24.183 --> 00:16:26.481
| can't say it looks good.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.187
But she desperately
wanted to talk to you.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.816
That's why we wanted you to come.

00:16:32.925 --> 00:16:34.086
Talk to me?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.785
Listen to me, Sheila.

00:16:35.895 --> 00:16:39.729
You must not tell anyone about
the grand master's condition.

00:16:39.932 --> 00:16:43.266
Things are unstable right now.
If people find out about it...

00:16:43.369 --> 00:16:46.532
...not only will it cause
unrest among the people...

00:16:46.739 --> 00:16:50.107
...but the warlocks might take
advantage of our situation.

00:16:53.146 --> 00:16:55.274
Grand Master. This is Sheila.

00:16:55.581 --> 00:16:59.142
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:16:59.352 --> 00:17:00.251
A favor?

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:05.219
Even if the warlocks capture all the
fairies and the True Book of Spells...

00:17:05.325 --> 00:17:09.125
...they still won't be
able to use dark magic.

00:17:09.228 --> 00:17:13.927
In order to use dark magic,
they'll need the power of a witch.

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:14.659
| see.

00:17:15.101 --> 00:17:17.832
According to my research...

00:17:17.937 --> 00:17:21.737
...the warlocks already have
this witch in their possession.

00:17:21.841 --> 00:17:24.572
The witch who can use dark magic.

00:17:24.644 --> 00:17:25.167
What?

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:30.211
| haven't even told this
to the Three Sages.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:34.015
| want you to find this person for me.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:38.421
Join forces with the warlocks and
find out who the traitor trying...

00:17:38.524 --> 00:17:40.686
...to use dark magic is.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.292
I have to find who the traitor is?

00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:45.258
But why me?

00:17:46.733 --> 00:17:50.226
Are you saying that one of
the Three Sages is the traitor?

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.701
| can't say it's not possible.

00:17:57.276 --> 00:17:59.711
Arusu. Are you going to leave us?

00:18:00.747 --> 00:18:03.546
Are you kidding me?
I'm not going anywhere.

00:18:03.683 --> 00:18:05.208
I made a promise to Wil.

00:18:05.318 --> 00:18:08.447
| also promised Nito that
I'm going to protect the magic.

00:18:08.554 --> 00:18:09.487
But...

00:18:09.756 --> 00:18:10.951
I'm home!

00:18:11.791 --> 00:18:13.850
What's with the surprised
look on your faces?

00:18:13.926 --> 00:18:15.087
It's just that...

00:18:15.194 --> 00:18:17.390
Oh, sorry about what I said earlier.

00:18:17.497 --> 00:18:21.627
You made a promise to both Wil and Nito.
You can't just go home now, right?

00:18:21.834 --> 00:18:24.826
That's right!
It's kind of obvious, isn't it?

00:18:25.171 --> 00:18:28.038
Hey, Arusu, was it
the Magical Girl Squad?

00:18:28.107 --> 00:18:29.541
That's just great!

00:18:29.609 --> 00:18:30.132
What?

00:18:30.243 --> 00:18:32.712
Hey, I'm going to cook today. Okay?

00:18:32.979 --> 00:18:36.643
It's a party to celebrate the
formation of Magical Girl Squad!

00:18:36.749 --> 00:18:37.716
Huh?

00:18:42.255 --> 00:18:42.949
There!

00:18:44.056 --> 00:18:45.251
Your meal is ready!

00:18:45.358 --> 00:18:47.952
Wow! Amazing! This is magnificent!

00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:50.459
What the heck, Sheila!
You can really cook!

00:18:50.563 --> 00:18:51.325
Sort of.

00:18:52.365 --> 00:18:56.393
Well, let me introduce myself.
My name is Arusu.

00:18:56.502 --> 00:18:58.470
| came to the Magical Realm and...

00:18:58.571 --> 00:19:00.437
Is this gonna be long?

00:19:00.573 --> 00:19:03.941
Bear with me for a second.
The reason why I was able to...

00:19:04.076 --> 00:19:06.704
...get this far is
because of these two...

00:19:06.813 --> 00:19:07.336
Yeah.

00:19:07.947 --> 00:19:09.142
Arusu...

00:19:09.248 --> 00:19:11.683
We should toast our friendship and...

00:19:11.784 --> 00:19:14.481
...the new formation of
the Magical Girl Squad.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.281
Cheers!

00:19:16.456 --> 00:19:17.184
There!

00:19:18.024 --> 00:19:19.822
Hey, eat as much as you can.

00:19:20.126 --> 00:19:21.924
Bon appétit!

00:19:24.464 --> 00:19:25.954
Delicious!

00:19:26.833 --> 00:19:29.894
I'll say this dinner is a winner!

00:19:30.002 --> 00:19:31.834
That wasn't funny at all!

00:19:31.938 --> 00:19:34.805
Now, now. Eat some more, Eva.

00:19:35.208 --> 00:19:36.952
Huh? I'm getting sleepy.

00:19:36.976 --> 00:19:38.171
Huh? I'm getting sleepy.
Me too...

00:19:38.311 --> 00:19:42.942
Oh yeah, what did the
grand master want, Sheila?

00:19:46.686 --> 00:19:47.619
Sheila?

00:19:48.688 --> 00:19:49.621
Arusu?

00:19:52.625 --> 00:19:54.354
Where were you?

00:19:54.627 --> 00:19:56.095
Where's Arusu?

00:19:57.063 --> 00:19:58.224
Sheila...

00:19:58.998 --> 00:20:00.227
You didn't...

00:20:01.934 --> 00:20:02.992
She's...

00:20:04.937 --> 00:20:07.099
Arusu isn't here anymore.

00:20:17.583 --> 00:20:25.547
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.791 --> 00:20:33.791
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.967 --> 00:20:42.967
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:49.774
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.882 --> 00:20:54.115
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.887 --> 00:20:59.120
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.225 --> 00:21:03.787
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.996 --> 00:21:09.162
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:12.329
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.973 --> 00:21:18.433
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.544 --> 00:21:21.036
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.147 --> 00:21:29.147
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.323 --> 00:21:36.057
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.162 --> 00:21:40.326
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
